OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 13, to compete in golf world
OL,4,Achampionship
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old golfer from Leominster
OL,7,Fhas secured a place at one of the
OL,8,Fworld's biggest junior golf
OL,9,Fcompetitions.
OL,11,FChloe said she was "really happy" to
OL,12,Fhave won Faldo Futures, a competition
OL,13,Fhosted by former English golfer and TV
OL,14,Fcommentator, Sir Nick Faldo, which
OL,15,Fmeans she will compete in the IMG
OL,16,FJunior World Championship in San Diego,
OL,17,FCalifornia, next year.
OL,19,F"It makes me feel really proud of
OL,20,Fmyself, especially after all the
OL,21,Fpractice I've done this summer," she
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
